# {{ project_name }} — agent instructions

## What this is

{{ description }} The repository is laid out by `ssus_paper_template`;
`.copier-answers.yml` records the template release.

## Layout

| Folder | Holds |
|---|---|
| `data/` | the data (git-ignored) |
| `notebooks/` | exploratory work |
| `src/{{ package }}/` | the project's code as a package, installed editable |
| `analysis/` | the run scripts; each writes raw output (CSV) to `results/` |
| `analysis/tables/` | the formatters; each reads `results/` and writes `paper/_tbl_<name>.md` with `ssus_papers.Table` |
| `results/` | the raw outputs |
| `paper/` | the manuscript, a Quarto project: `paper.qmd`, `title-page.qmd`, `_quarto.yml` (title, abstract, authorship; no formats), and one profile per copy: `_quarto-working.yml` (the default), `_quarto-blind.yml` (the journal's knobs), `_quarto-titlepage.yml` |
| `paper/_output/` | each copy's render, one folder per profile (git-ignored) |
| `slides/` | the talk, a Quarto project: `slides.qmd` |
| `submissions/` | each submission as sent: the bundle, `MANIFEST.txt`, and `source/`, the paper's source as rendered (tracked; never edited) |

## Build

- Every command is a pixi task: `pixi task list`, then `pixi run <task>`.
  Shell belongs inside a task in `pixi.toml`, never in a loose script.
- Run analysis as `pixi run python analysis/<script>.py`.
- The formats are dependencies. `pixi run init` and `pixi run formats`
  install them at the pins in `pixi.toml`, and the installed `_extensions/`
  folders are committed. Never copy, edit, or patch an extension folder: a
  format changes in its own repository and arrives here by a new pin.

## Rules

- The analysis writes raw outputs; the formatters make the tables. No
  number is typed into the manuscript by hand.
- Every copy of the paper (working paper, blind manuscript, title page) is
  built from `paper/paper.qmd` and `paper/_quarto.yml`, by `pixi run
  render`, so the copies stay in step. The identity lives in `_quarto.yml`;
  the blind format and the blind profile's filter omit it. Never try to
  remove it with a profile's keys, which merge and cannot.
- Keep formats out of `_quarto.yml`: a profile's formats merge with the
  base's, and every copy's formats would render under every profile.
- A submission is frozen by `pixi run submit LABEL` and never edited
  after; a resubmission is a new label. Diff against it with
  `pixi run diff submissions/LABEL/source`.
- No task or script stages, commits, or tags anything in git.
